    Note over P,B: Nine area cards sit along flove's navigation hierarchy
    P->>F: open flove.org
    F-->>P: home · docs · About tour
    P->>A: follow Apps in the primary nav
    A-->>P: categories → single apps
    Note over A: Key fields + Exported prompts live at app level
    A->>W: open apps/sys/wizy
    W-->>P: Where is Wizy? — nine cards
    P->>W: tap Custom magic insights
    W-->>P: portrait → quiet layer → thought · tour CTA
    Note over W: the intro card frames all nine
    W->>I: descend into an app surface
    I->>I: Appy Magic — three wizards, Myself / With others
    I-->>P: Labelers re-voice · Raty asks · Helpers explain
    Note over I: Key fields hint while filling · four cards live inside apps
    I->>B: cross the app boundary
    B-->>P: External embeds — micro · minimal · compact · full
    B->>B: (G)Local Browsy — scoped grant, consent before Nety
    alt Wizy present
        I-->>P: gentle suggestion offered
    else Wizy absent
        I-->>P: neutral prompt, not an empty button
